{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2022-12-13 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT NAMED TO DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX FOR FOURTH YEAR IN A ROW', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX (DJSI) NORTH AMERICA FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR.'}